{"id":"n78968-1-12","stage":4,"title":"출간 · 出刊","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78968-1-12-1","ko":"작가님 출간 예정일이 언제지요?","zh":"作家老师，预计什么时候出版呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"작가님","meaning":"作家","explanation":"작가：作家；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"작가","audio":"/audio/07dda968bf6b7241b33c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58277","senseId":"1","lemma":"작가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"출간","meaning":"出刊，出版","explanation":"출간：出刊，出版","readings":[{"term":"출간","audio":"/audio/7e69f05080c9224d322d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78968","senseId":"1","lemma":"출간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예정일이","meaning":"预定日","explanation":"예정일：预定日；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"예정일","audio":"/audio/8c568cd5cfb56bacef33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70092","senseId":"1","lemma":"예정일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제지요?","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"07dda968bf6b7241","term":"작가","zh":"作家","audio":"/audio/07dda968bf6b7241b33c.mp3","entryId":"58277","definition":"原创出诗歌、小说、剧本、画等的人。","pronunciation":["작까"]},{"id":"7e69f05080c9224d","term":"출간","zh":"出刊，出版","audio":"/audio/7e69f05080c9224d322d.mp3","entryId":"78968","definition":"将文字、画作或乐谱等印刷成册，使其问世。","pronunciation":["출간"]},{"id":"8c568cd5cfb56bac","term":"예정일","zh":"预定日","audio":"/audio/8c568cd5cfb56bacef33.mp3","entryId":"70092","definition":"预想某事要发生或决定干某事的日期。","pronunciation":["예ː정일"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]}],"audio":"/audio/f3085072087db46f04fd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78968-1-12-2","ko":"다음 달은 되어야 책으로 나올 것 같습니다.","zh":"大概要到下个月才能以书的形式问世吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달은","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되어야","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책으로","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나올","meaning":"上市，出品，出版","explanation":"나오다：上市，出品，出版；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"11","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같습니다.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"上市，出品，出版","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"商品被生产出来或人物出现。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1ae4d84bfa6a797ec216.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78968","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":144,"sequenceScore":2.8627,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["作家老师，预计什么时候出版呢？","大概要到下个月才能以书的形式问世吧。","那是什么资料啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["作家老师，预计什么时候出版呢？","大概要到下个月才能以书的形式问世吧。","那是什么资料啊？"],"answer":1}]}
